Author & Forgotten Werewolf
Author
Forgotten Werewolf
The Author/Creator and Forgotten Werewolf/Lost Werewolf have no set abilities. The Host and players may agree on specific rules for them before the game starts. The Author and Creator can have different abilities, as can the two Werewolves.
Host
The Host card is for the player in charge of running the game.
